{"id": "DeqQdjgxiai", "title": "Video by visionmachina", "description": "Tag @teslamotors to get your allocation.\n\nVision Machina has unveiled the Roadster Machina Edition, an all-terrain take on the long-awaited Roadster that’s set to arrive at some point before 2049.\n\nThe widebody coupe sits on bronze deep-dish wheels with riveted over-fenders and long-travel arches. It’s tuned for sand, snow, rock and the occasional road. For anything past that, it offers up to 1,000 km of flight. Inside, a body-morph cabin finished in tan aniline leather, navy suede and copper reshapes itself to the driver before they sit down. The car also starts only for its owner’s heartbeat.\n\nProduction is limited to 50 units, all of which have been reserved for everyone. Allocation is reportedly handled by tagging @teslamotors in the comments. Sources close to the project describe the delivery window as “confident.”\n\nTake a closer look at the Roadster Machina Edition above, and stay tuned for a release date that may or may not arrive.", "channel": "visionmachina", "uploader_id": "71483437226", "uploader": "VISION MACHINA", "timestamp": 1792379721, "like_count": 131, "comment_count": 4, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1105224852231115a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.781, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNlQBXd3M2TL0YfYLW50aHVmSmlxaQPQslixAdSX1lKePk6ZXs7d3P-EaRnz7crqrszVymDL0t5IHDQnykXno-XQNBV10BmdnKJCnY.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Ado6-2RUkmnxjk31Q-WljL_alJ6__SfhgkeLzt5iwVrqYWiENOM9TZYGBJAmugU0MUnGiOptamYLF0Bip9M3cqsh&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=g98Vn-ONgVUQ7kNvwGj-Tce&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=2egg9Jcc_0vSKLwIFaZlqw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSYxxx6GEZXMrrygVBp_3_5E2dcNI-5boPKRqr78JbqiA&oe=6AF43BE5", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_da